ration reference\",\"Water\",\"Published environmental calibration sample\",\"Published measurement\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"discharge\",\"discharge_ft3_s\",\"121\",\"120\",\"https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf\",\"7783717d890ffc902096823a626b080cbaa457bc82977ebe97961abc74881e26\",\"748cb4ef126b346d001fe86211ee6b2a2632712e36889862056c8a28036cd5ff\",\"42f9679306a429c6df3f3fe62922bb8bfd47bb556fa0f203b5b912c6203192fa\",\"Authored long-table interchange from original published row 120, column discharge_ft3_s. Full original CSV/provenance/table text retained. Unknown clock time, timezone, laboratory protocol and hydrologic event are not inferred.\"\r\n","mapping":{"_wqp_detection":"wqp-detection-conditions/v2","station":"stationId","organization":"organization","activity":"activityId","result":"resultId","date":"sampledDate","datetime":"sampledAt","time":"","zone":"timeZone","characteristic":"characteristic","value":"value","unit":"unit","detection":"detection","qualifier":"qualifier","fraction":"fraction","status":"status","valueType":"valueType","medium":"medium","activityType":"activityType","method":"method","laboratory":"","pcode":"","name":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","datum":"","comment":"notes"},"origin":{"type":"source-preserving-reference-projection","adapter":"upstate.usgs-07144100-calibration-intake/v1","sourceUrl":"https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf","sourceMetadata":{"schema":"upstate.public-sediment-reference/v1","title":"USGS Little Arkansas River near Sedgwick calibration table, 2004–2014","source_url":"https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf","source_document":"USGS Office of Surface Water Technical Memorandum 2016.07 / Office of Water Quality Technical Memorandum 2016.10","source_document_date":"2016-09-30","source_location":"Attachment B, model archive summary; 120-row calibration table, printed pages 24–25 (PDF pages 24–25 when counted from 1)","station":"07144100","station_name":"Little Arkansas River near Sedgwick, Kansas","model_id":"07144100.SSC.WY07.1","sensor":{"id":"YSI 6600 / 6136","method":"Optical turbidity, YSI model 6136","unit":"FNU"},"analyte":"SSC","response_unit":"mg/L","discharge_unit":"ft3/s","discharge_conversion":{"to":"m3/s","factor":0.028316846592,"definition":"1 international foot = 0.3048 metres; cubic conversion is exact"},"date_precision":"date only; no clock time or timezone is supplied by the published table","pairing":"Each numbered published table row supplies concurrent SSC, turbidity and discharge. Original row numbers identify distinct samples, including repeated dates. A shared calendar date does not combine samples or establish independent hydrologic events.","transcription":{"method":"Extract published table text, select original raw SSC/TURB/Q columns, preserve printed decimal values and row order; discard no rows. No published rounded logarithms used for fitting.","rows":120,"distinct_dates":115,"range":{"start":"2004-07-27","end":"2014-08-04"},"duplicate_source_rows_checked":true,"conflicts":0,"limitations":"These are values at the precision printed in the USGS model archive summary, not the original laboratory or sensor CSV byte stream. Original author removed seven samples before this published120-row table; their complete original values are not contained here."},"published_model":{"equation":"log10(SSC mg/L) = 0.262 + 0.933 log10(turbidity FNU) + 0.0431 log10(discharge ft3/s)","smearing_factor":1.02,"retransformed_equation":"SSC = 1.865 * turbidity^0.933 * discharge_ft3_s^0.0431","comparison":"Published coefficients are rounded. Re-fitting uses the raw columns at published precision; convert discharge units before comparing the intercept."},"course":{"full_calibration":"All120 published samples assigned to training to reproduce the archive coefficients; this is a calibration reproduction.","temporal_validation":"Separate study: dates before2012-01-01 assigned to training; dates from2012-01-01 assigned to validation. This is a new explicitly declared temporal holdout exercise, not the author's published cross-validation or independent new monitoring data."},"license":"United States Geological Survey federal publication; source attribution retained.","retrieved_at":"2026-10-13","csv_sha256":"7783717d890ffc902096823a626b080cbaa457bc82977ebe97961abc74881e26"},"constants":{"stationId":{"value":"07144100","basis":"https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf; model 07144100.SSC.WY07.1"},"organization":{"value":"USGS published calibration reference","basis":"Source attribution; this is an authored interchange field, not a native WQP organization ID"},"sensorId":{"value":"YSI 6600 / 6136","basis":"Original published model archive sensor declaration"},"sensorMethod":{"value":"Optical turbidity, YSI model 6136","basis":"Original published model archive sensor declaration"},"sedimentAnalyte":{"value":"SSC","basis":"Original SSC mg/L column; never TSS"},"sedimentMethod":{"value":"Published SSC; laboratory protocol not stated in selected table","basis":"Unknown laboratory protocol remains explicit; complete publication extraction is retained"},"dischargeMethod":{"value":"Published concurrent discharge; instrument protocol not stated in selected table","basis":"Original Q ft3/s column; no instrument inferred"},"datePrecision":{"value":"date","basis":"Original table has no clock time or timezone"},"status":{"value":"Published calibration reference","basis":"Requires an explicit original native reviewer decision; not substituted Approved"},"eventMeaning":{"value":"sample","basis":"Numbered original table row gives concurrent values, not a hydrologic-event identity"}},"pages":[{"name":"usgs_07144100_sediment_2004_2014.csv","mediaType":"text/csv","bytes":3153,"sha":"7783717d890ffc902096823a626b080cbaa457bc82977ebe97961abc74881e26","text":"published_row,sample_date,ssc_mg_L,turbidity_FNU,discharge_ft3_s\n1,2004-07-27,384,200,5850\n2,2005-01-27,122,8