7 0.0194 0.242 --\nL739@P24: 110 2014-04-09 1.34 1.04 1.48 22 11 30.5 1.3 20.2 0.0446 0.634 --\nL740@P24: 111 2014-05-08 1.66 1.3 1.34 46 20 22 1.53 34.8 0.129 1.41 --\nL741@P24: 112 2014-06-03 1.76 1.53 1.71 58 34 50.8 1.76 59.3 -0.00127 -0.094 --\nL742@P24: 113 2014-06-05 2.11 1.84 2.15 130 69 141 2.07 120 0.0434 0.584 --\nL743@P24: 114 2014-06-09 2.45 2.26 3.17 285 180 1470 2.5 325 -0.0483 -0.512 --\nL744@P24: 115 2014-06-12 2.64 2.34 3.59 441 220 3880 2.6 408 0.0419 0.56 --\nL745@P24: 116 2014-06-24 2.2 1.95 2.44 157 90 278 2.19 158 0.00493 -0.0731 --\nL746@P24: 117 2014-07-10 1.76 1.57 1.95 57 37.3 88.3 1.81 66.2 -0.0571 -0.768 --\nL747@P24: 118 2014-07-15 1.77 1.51 1.66 59 32.3 46 1.74 56.3 0.0284 0.396 --\nL748@P24: 119 2014-07-24 1.72 1.47 1.45 52 29.8 28 1.7 51.1 0.0155 0.157 --\nL749@P24-25: 120 2014-08-04 1.79 1.44 1.33 62 27.5 21.2 1.66 46.8 0.13 1.46 --26\nL750@P25: Definitions\nL751@P25: SSC: Suspended-sediment concentration (SSC) in mg/L (80154)\nL752@P25: TURB: Turbidity in FNU (63680)\nL753@P25-26: Q: Streamflow, in ft3/s (00060)27\nL754@P26: Attachment C. Example Model Archive Summary for an Acoustic Suspended Sediment Model\nL755@P26: Model Archive Summary for Suspended-Sediment Concentration at\nL756@P26: Station 01648010; Rock Creek at Joyce Road at Washington, DC\nL757@P26: This model archive summary documents the suspended-sediment concentration (SSC) model developed to\nL758@P26: compute 15-minute SSC for the U.S. Geological Survey (USGS) station, Rock Creek at Joyce Road (USGS ID:\nL759@P26: 01648010) from October 1, 2014 onward. This is the first model developed for the site to compute continuous\nL760@P26: SSC. The methods used follow USGS guidance as referenced in relevant Office of Surface Water/Office of\nL761@P26: Water Quality Technical Memoranda and USGS Techniques and Methods, book 3, chap. C5 (Landers and\nL762@P26: others, 2016).\nL763@P26: Site and Model Information\nL764@P26: Site number: 01648010\nL765@P26: Site name: Rock Creek at Joyce Rd, Washington, DC\nL766@P26: Location: Lat 38°57'36.6\", long 77°02'31.4\" (NAD 1927), Washington, DC, Hydrologic Unit: 02070010, on right\nL767@P26: bank at downstream side of bridge on Joyce Road.\nL768@P26: Drainage area: 62.7 mi2\nL769@P26: Model number: 01648010.SSC.WY15.1\nL770@P26: Date model was created: September 9, 2016\nL771@P26: Model calibration data period: October 8, 2014 to May 03, 2016\nL772@P26: Model application date: October 8, 2014 onwards\nL773@P26: Computed by: Joseph Bell, USGS, MD.DE.DC WSC (jmbell@usgs.gov)\nL774@P26: Reviewed by: Timothy Straub, USGS, IL-IA WSC (tdstraub@usgs.gov), and Mark Landers, USGS, OSW\nL775@P26: (landers@usgs.gov)\nL776@P26: Approved by: USGS, Center Director, MD.DE.DC Water Science Center\nL777@P26: Model Data\nL778@P26: All model data were collected using USGS protocols described in Edwards and Glysson (1999), Landers and\nL779@P26: others (2016), and the USGS National Field Manual. All data are stored in the National Water Information\nL780@P26: System (NWIS) database (http://dx.doi.org/10.5066/F7P55KJN).\nL781@P26: Suspended sediment characteristics at this site are computed from a regression model based on measured\nL782@P26: suspended sediment characteristics and sediment-corrected backscatter (𝑆𝑆������). The regression model is based\nL783@P26: on 41 concurrent measurements of SSC and 𝑆𝑆������ collected from October 8, 2014, through May 3, 2016. An\nL784@P26: additional 51 concurrent data sets collected during this period were evaluated and excluded from the\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf)\n【turn309view2】<<ImageDisplayed>>\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://water.usgs.gov/admin/memo/SW/sw.2016.07%2Bwq.2016.10.pdf)\n【turn309view3】<<ImageDisplayed>>"}],"projection":{"originalRows":120,"rows":360,"identity":"Original publication model + published row + original value column","pairing":"Explicit same published sample row; repeated dates remain separate","eventMeaning":"sample; hydrologic independence unassessed","sourceQC":"Published-reference status requires an explicit native review","originalWQPSource":false}},"summary":{"rows":360,"rejectedCount":0,"stationCount":1,"censored":0,"parameters":{"unmapped":240,"flow":120},"issues":{"unmapped-characteristic-or-fraction":240,"review-source-status":360,"unrecognized-unit":120}},"rejected":[]}],"contexts":[{"id":"d73024f6ccc5dd5b4c673120cee9dac8317bcace0a6dc6eb6b3b2e7884204287","review":{"state":"include","reviewer":"Authored connected source exercise","reason":"Source-interface exercise only; actual native source review remains required.","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","selectVersion":false},"selectedVersion":null,"variants":["d73024f6ccc5dd5b4c673120cee9dac8317bcace0a6dc6eb6b3b2e7884204287"]},{"id":"eb950efabe7bda2398f8c622c0d31ee9c5fc7642a4aad07741eb4a91989ad316","review":{"state":"include","reviewer":"Authored connected source exercise","reason":"Source-interface exercise only; actual native source review remains required.","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","selectVersion":false},"selectedVersion":null,"variants":["eb950efabe7bda2398f8c622c0d31ee9c5fc7642a4aad07741eb4a91989ad316"]},{"id":"72ddb131df410483016e22fc1b621c12bded5bc2a914cfaf4dd0c5552a1fae5a","review":{"state":"include","reviewer":"Authored connected source exercise","reason":"Source-interface exercise only; actual native source review remains required.","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z","selectVersion":false},"selectedVersion":null,"variants":["72ddb131df410483016e22fc1b621c12bded5bc2a914cfaf4dd0c5552a1fae5a"]},{"id":"67caee60a13725840ca6410aa03e1d7fdcc018006757147a66c0c82caed18a14","review":{"state":"include","reviewer":"Authored connected source exercise","reason":"Source-interface exercise only; actual native source review remains required.","updatedAt"